# The trusted computing base of this repo. Anything here changes WHAT is
# proved (intents, spec lock) or HOW it is checked (gate, toolchain, CI).
# With branch protection "Require review from Code Owners" enabled, a green
# build alone can never merge a change to these.
/intents/               @fritzClaw
/specs.lock.json        @fritzClaw
/tools/                 @fritzClaw
/scripts/               @fritzClaw
/.github/               @fritzClaw
/.claude/               @fritzClaw
/CLAUDE.md              @fritzClaw
/Cargo.toml             @fritzClaw
/rust-toolchain.toml    @fritzClaw
/verus-toolchain.env    @fritzClaw
/vendored.toml          @fritzClaw

# Vendored verified library (and its intent/skill, listed above via /intents/
# and /.claude/): changes only via scripts/vendor-sync.sh from upstream.
/lib-security-property/ @fritzClaw

# katas/** is deliberately NOT owned: proof/implementation PRs only need CI.
# A change to a kata's frozen spec fails `vc check` unless specs.lock.json is
# re-locked, which pulls the PR back under code-owner review.
